  "originalQuery": "Your customer is developing a chat application for social networking. Users can send messages in real time, which may include text, images, and videos. The application needs to handle millions of users with low-latency message delivery and support flexible data structures for user profiles and chat metadata. Which database should you use?",
  "originalOptions": "A. Use Bigtable with row keys structured for user chats.<br/>B. Use Firestore in Datastore mode.<br/>C. Use Firestore in Native mode.<br/>D. Use Cloud SQL with read replicas for scalability.",
