  "qid": "137",
  "tip": "<p>Map the workload to the access pattern. When you see messaging with web and mobile clients and <i>real time</i> sync and a <i>flexible</i> document model, think <i>Firestore in Native mode</i>. If you see rigid schemas or heavy relational joins then consider other services.</p>",
